LICENSE: TBD (To Be Determined)

This project is currently in the research and development stage and does
not yet have a final license.

IMPORTANT — Pending license review:

The project depends on the following third-party components
(among others), whose licenses MUST be reviewed before choosing and
publishing a final license for this project:

  - DeepLabCut 3.0.1 ....... LGPL-3.0-or-later (check the exact version and
                             distribution; model weights are separate)
  - PyTorch ................ BSD-3-Clause
  - PySide6 / Qt 6 ........ LGPL-3.0 / GPL (LGPL compliance required for
                             dynamic linking; Qt licensing reviewed at
                             packaging time)
  - OpenCV ................ Apache-2.0 (opencv-python is Apache-2.0;
                             note some contrib modules differ)
  - FFmpeg ................ LGPL-2.1+ / GPL (depends on build
                             configuration)
  - NumPy / SciPy / Pandas . BSD-3-Clause (NumPy/SciPy),
                             BSD-3-Clause (Pandas)
  - Model weights .......... license of each pretrained model must be
                             checked individually

A license decision is tracked as a roadmap task (see
docs/decisions/ and docs/roadmap.md). Until the license review is
complete, this main-branch placeholder grants no additional rights.
The GitHub repository is public. ADR-0011 records an MIT direction, and
the historical v0.1.0 Mac test release declares MIT for its main program;
that release remains governed by its own license materials. The current
main-branch license and next distribution policy are being confirmed.

Do NOT initiate a new public distribution of the current main branch
before the license is finalized and third-party license obligations
(including libraries, bundled binaries, and model weights) are resolved.
